    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional 3 Bedroom Mid-Terrace House In The Heart of the Historical & Sylvanian Setting of Quin\r\n\r\nMoinear na Darach is an exclusive, low-density development renowned for its quality homes and peaceful surroundings, offering a welcome escape from the pace of everyday life.\r\n\r\nNo. 18 is a superb three-bedroom mid terrace residence, designed with both comfort and practicality in mind. The heart of the home is a bright and spacious open-plan living, kitchen, and dining area, complete with a beautifully appointed kitchen that caters perfectly to modern family\r\nliving and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the first floor features stylish laminate flooring throughout and comprises three generously sized bedrooms, each offering ample space and natural light.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property boasts a beautifully maintained garden with uninterrupted views over landscaped green areas. Enjoying a sunny southerly aspect, the garden provides excellent privacy and is not overlooked."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The following is the accommodation and approximate room dimensions:-\r\n \r\n                                                                                                                                      Sq mtrs\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance Hall (laminated flooring)                                                                                  4.40 x 2.00\r\nKitchen/Living/Dining Area (laminated flooring)                                                              9.93 x 3.95\r\nUtility (laminate flooring & plumbed for washing machine/dryer)                                    2.00 x 1.40\r\nW.C. & W.H.B. (ceramic tiled flooring)                                                                            2.00 x 1.45\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\r\nMaster Bedroom (laminate flooring, built in wardrobes, ensuite (ceramic tiled flooring) 4.37 x 3.85\r\nBedroom 2 (laminate flooring)                                                                                         3.77 x 2.75\r\nBedroom 3 (laminate flooring & built in wardrobes)                                                        3.77 x 3.20\r\nBathroom (shower, w.c., w.h.b., ceramic tiled flooring)                                                   3.01 x 2.10\r\n\r\nThe total f loor area is approximately 116 sq. mtrs (1248 sq. ft)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Air to water heating (under floor heating on ground floor with radiators on first floor).\r\n* Fitted wiht smoke & carbon monoxide alarms.\r\n* Pull down ladder access.\r\n* 10 year Homebond Guarantee.\r\n* Concrete build with concrete floor at first level."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Located just east of Ennis, the picturesque village of Quin enjoys an ideal setting close to major employment centres, with Ennis approximately 9km away, Shannon 14km, and Limerick just 24km. \r\n\r\nRenowned for its rich historical heritage, both within the village and the surrounding countryside, Quin is a highly desirable location that attracts visitors and tourists throughout the year.\r\n\r\nNo. 18 Moinear na Darach is superbly positioned just off the Ballykilty Road, to the rear of the well-established Maigh Dara development, and is\r\nwithin a pleasant short stroll of Quin village centre.\r\n\r\nQuin has successfully retained its traditional character and charm while offering an excellent range of modern amenities. These include a superb primary school, attractive village shops, welcoming pubs and restaurants, a health centre, Catholic church, and a thriving GAA club, making\r\nit an ideal location for family living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing by prior appointment only with sole selling agents"
      }
    ],
